                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I Gaza hazarekwa, na Ashikeloni hazaba umusaka, abo kuri Ashidodi bazirukanwa ku manywa y'ihangu, na Ekuroni hazasenywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatuye ku nkombe z'inyanja ubwoko bw'Abakereti bazagusha ishyano! Ijambo ry'Uwiteka riri kuri mwe, Banyakanāni mwe: “Igihugu cy'Abafilisitiya nzakirimbura he kugira uhasigara.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibibaya byo ku nyanja bizaba ibyanya, bibemo ibiraro by'abashumba n'ibikumba by'intama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibibaya byo ku nyanja bizaba iby'abasigaye bo mu nzu ya Yuda, ni ho bazaragira intama zabo. Bazajya barara mu mazu ya Ashikeloni, kuko Uwiteka azabagenderera akagarura abajyanywe ari imbohe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
